alue of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025 on the middle of the grids, January to February hit 52% of normal and June to July 138%. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 198% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 22348 had its driest year in 1953 at 55% of normal.</p>"}
